cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Alphea in research or build on it, please cite it as below."
title: "Alphea: an emotion- and risk-aware customer service chatbot"
abstract: >-
  A Rasa-based customer service chatbot that combines emotion detection,
  zero-shot criticality scoring and aspect-based sentiment analysis to decide
  when a conversation should be escalated to a human agent, with an agent
  dashboard and automatically generated analytics datasets. Originally
  developed as a university thesis project.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ziad
    family-names: Jreij
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ziad-Jreij/alphea-chatbot"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.2
date-released: "2026-11-22"
keywords:
  - chatbot
  - customer service
  - rasa
  - emotion detection
  - aspect-based sentiment analysis
  - zero-shot classification
  - escalation
